# Allowlist for the media-sandbox build context (repo root): the lock, the project sources, the sandbox files and,
# for the media-test target, the tests. Everything else (.venv, .git, caches, docs) stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!deploy/sandbox/
!tests/
!conftest.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
